    <abstract>
      <para>
        &sles4sap; is the leading Linux platform for &hana;, &s4h; and &netweaver;. Two of the key
        components of &productnameshort; are &sleha; (&slehaa;) and resource agents (RAs).
        &slehaa; provides &pace;, an open-source cluster framework. The resource agents manage
        automated failover of &hanasr;, &s4hana; ASCS/ERS, and &nwshort; ASCS/ERS.
      </para>
      <para>
         This document provides an overview of the &ha; solutions that &suse; supports for &s4hana;
         and &nwshort; on &productnameshort; 15 and 16. New solutions will be added when they
         become available.
      </para>
    </abstract>
